        "Name": "Snowflame Malice",
        "Details": "The Snowflame Malice was originally a Ghost Bear design. When the Republic Institute of Strategic Combat wanted to refine the original MAL-Y-SH-LAZR (a variant of the Malice designed to carry 4 Hyper Lasers into combat), they decided to use the Snowflame as the base mech and equipped it with even newer laser weaponry than the design it replaced. The mech mounts a very straightforward loadout of two RISC Hyper Lasers and two newly developed Fire-Linked Short-Pulse Trinary Hyper Lasers. The FLSPTH Lasers can only fit in the torso, and generate massive heat output that require extensive cooling systems to manage. As backup weaponry, a quartet of Streak SRM4s are included to dissuade any light units from getting too close.",
